      "contributors": [],
      "id": "ac0cc537-02ca-4357-849f-3e8ece879782",
      "in_app": true,
      "markdown": "\nSwitch between Activity and Access Checks on the Auditing page. Group checks by time, then open a summary to inspect individual records and compare Then with Now. New installs retain audits for one year, including 30 days in the database.\n\n[Open Access Checks](/audit/access-checks)\n\n![Auditing with grouped checks and a compact record selector.](assets/ac0cc537-02ca-4357-849f-3e8ece879782/access-checks.png)",
      "published_at": "2026-10-17T04:04:15Z",
      "revision": 2,
      "sources": [
        {
          "pr": 994,
          "role": "implementation"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Review Access Checks in One Place",
      "type": "New"
    },
    {
      "action_required": false,
      "area": "Agents",
      "assets": [],
      "contributors": [],
      "id": "de613145-5d41-4f02-87dc-6e5c0fdee054",
      "in_app": true,
      "markdown": "\nAgents can now run as another user from the SDK with `run_as`, like workflows. Both need Impersonate Users in that user's organization instead of Platform Admin, and Platform Admins keep it. Run As shows on the agent run, and Access Checks records each impersonation.\n\n[Open Roles](/roles) \u00b7 [Open Access Checks](/audit/access-checks)",
      "published_at": "2026-10-10T08:09:56Z",
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "pr": 968,
          "role": "implementation"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Run Agents as Another User",
      "type": "New"
    },
    {
      "action_required": false,
      "area": "Administration",
      "assets": [],
      "contributors": [],
      "id": "a9042643-be28-46ff-9e58-2c6b9e5eb02a",
      "in_app": true,
      "markdown": "\nEvery admin-only power now has a named permission. Access Checks records, report-only, when someone uses one their roles don't grant. New: Run Agents, Use AI, Read AI Model Information, Impersonate Users, Read and Write Privileged Access, Read Basic views. Four are renamed. Nobody's access changes.\n\n[Open Access Checks](/audit/access-checks) \u00b7 [Open Roles](/roles)",
      "published_at": "2026-10-09T19:51:09Z",
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "pr": 967,
          "role": "implementation"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Named Permissions in Access Checks",
      "type": "Improved"
    },
    {
