      "id": "293d312e-a4b4-42b0-a7ee-85b4e8ab4ad8",
      "in_app": true,
      "markdown": "\nChoose the identity a workflow runs as when no one starts it, and grant it what its past runs needed. Test what anyone could do, and review checks that would be denied. Nothing is enforced yet.\n\n[Open Identities](/users/identities) \u00b7 [Open Access Checks](/audit/access-checks)\n\n![A workflow's Access tab with Recommended Access](assets/293d312e-a4b4-42b0-a7ee-85b4e8ab4ad8/recommended-access.png)",
