      "id": "21f60d8e-18e9-5a5d-a730-e7d55cd77a3a",
      "in_app": false,
      "markdown": "\nUpdated pydantic-ai to 2.53.0, which patches [GHSA-6fqq-452j-qhrp](https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/security/advisories/GHSA-6fqq-452j-qhrp). No affected wrappers were found in platform code. The docs-tooling js-yaml update bounds YAML merge CPU use. The SimpleWebAuthn browser update does not change an affected server package.",
